    <section class="blog-intro pop-in">
        <h2>Why "The Cutting Room"?</h2>
        <p>The cutting room is where stories truly come alive. It's the space where raw footage transforms into narrative, where pacing creates emotion, and where creative decisions define the final experience. This blog represents that same process of refinement - taking experiences, insights, and observations from the filmmaking world and crafting them into something meaningful to share.</p>
        <p>Whether you're a fellow filmmaker, someone interested in the creative process, or just curious about what happens behind the camera, these posts offer a window into the thought processes, challenges, and discoveries that make filmmaking such a compelling art form.</p>
